{GRAVITY ZERO} If you played 2 or more non-creature cards this turn, you may summon this creature for no cost.
■ Neo Evolution: You may put this creature on top of one of your light, water or nature creatures. (If a card is under it, treat it as a Neo Evolution Creature.)
{DOUBLE BREAKER}

■ Neo Evolution: You may put this creature on top of one of your water, darkness or fire creatures. (If a card is under it, treat it as a Neo Evolution Creature.)
{DOUBLE BREAKER}
■ When this creature untaps, if it's not an evolution creature, discard a card from your hand.

■ Double Sympathy: Tamaseed (This creature costs 2 less to summon for each of your Tamaseeds. It can't cost 0 or less.)
{BLOCKER} (You may tap this creature to change the attack target of your opponent's creature to this creature.)
{TRIPLE BREAKER}

■ Neo Evolution: You may put this creature on top of one of your darkness, fire or nature creatures. (If a card is under it, treat it as a Neo Evolution Creature.)
■ If you summon this as a Neo Evolution Creature, this creature costs 2 less to summon.
{DOUBLE BREAKER}

{BLOCKER} (You may tap this creature to change the attack target of your opponent's creature to this creature.)
{DOUBLE BREAKER}
■ When you put this creature or whenever one of your creatures wins a battle, draw a card. Then you may put a creature that has "blocker" from your hand.

■ At the end of your opponent's turn, if your opponent has at least 4 or more creatures than you do and you have no 'Blue Impulse', you may summon this creature for no cost.
{TRIPLE BREAKER}
{SMASH BURST} (Whenever this creature attacks, you may cast its spell side in the battle zone for no cost.)

{MACH FIGHTER} (This creature can attack tapped or untapped creatures on the turn you put it.) {TRIPLE BREAKER}
■ Whenever one of your creatures would leave, you may put them into your mana zone instead.
■ Whenever this creature wins a battle, you may put a creature that costs the same as or less than the number of cards in your mana zone from your mana zone.

{TRIPLE BREAKER}
■ When you summon this creature or whenever this creature attacks, choose up to 2 creatures and return them to their owner's hand.
■ Whenever your opponent puts a creature or casts a spell, you may skip the rest of the turn.

{FUSHIGIVERSE} Darkness/Nature 8 (You may put one of your creatures into your mana zone tapped to summon this creature from your graveyard for a cost equal to Darkness/Nature 8 minus that creature's cost. It can't cost less than Darkness/Nature 2.)
{MACH FIGHTER} (This creature can attack tapped or untapped creatures on the turn you put it.) {SLAYER} (Whenever this creature battles, destroy the other creature after the battle.) {DOUBLE BREAKER}
■ Last Burst
